# initdata.toml is the PREIMAGE of MRCONFIGID. Any byte git changes on the way
# in or out changes the digest and breaks every verifier.
#
# -text disables end-of-line normalisation. Without it, a clone on Windows (or
# any clone with core.autocrlf set) gets CRLF, sha384sum returns a different
# value than the node reports, and the node looks like it is lying.
initdata.toml -text -diff=auto
* -text
